  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "2Spade takes his tea with a dollop of honey. It calms hims, he says.\r\n\r\nHe
    hasn\u2019t taken his earliest weeks in the Order well. 2Club sits next to him
    in the mess hall every day at the exact same time, early evening. She is surprisingly
    punctual, for someone who is always being chewed out for lack of discipline.
    The research division officers rarely have patience for slackers.\r\n\r\nThey
    drink tea together, but no honey for her. 2Club hates honey.\r\n\r\nThis, he
    knows full well. She mentioned it when they were in Basic, and it stuck in 2Spade\u2019s
    brain. Like many other things about 2Club. It is easy to think about her. Comfortable."
